# PhoenixPME Legal Documentation

## 📚 Overview
This directory contains all legal documentation for the PhoenixPME project.

## 📜 License Options

### 1. Open Source License (GNU GPL v3.0)
For open source, academic, and personal use:
- Full GNU GPL v3.0 terms apply
- See: [`/LICENSE`](/LICENSE) (root directory)
- Summary: [`docs/legal/LICENSE_NOTICE.md`](docs/legal/LICENSE_NOTICE.md)

### 2. Commercial License
For business/commercial deployment without GPL requirements:
- Custom terms with royalty structure
- Includes support and consulting
- See: [`docs/legal/COMMERCIAL_TERMS.md`](docs/legal/COMMERCIAL_TERMS.md)

⚠️ **Important:** All commercial fees flow to the Community Reserve Fund, same as public platform. No individual (including founder) can withdraw.

## 🤝 Contributor Agreement
All contributors must agree to:
- [`docs/legal/CONTRIBUTOR_AGREEMENT.md`](docs/legal/CONTRIBUTOR_AGREEMENT.md)

